    "body": "Can you also remove\r\n\r\n> For the purposes of [reflection](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#reflect), the [canonical keyword](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#canonical-keyword) for the [Anonymous](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-crossorigin-anonymous) state is the [anonymous](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-crossorigin-anonymous-keyword) keyword.\r\n\r\nas that's no longer needed with this. (Which means the explicit canonical keyword concept might not be needed, but that's probably best evaluated post ARIA.)",
